MapLibre\/MLNShape","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" noted above from GeoJSON data. To access a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shape’s attributes, use the corresponding ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" class instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can add shapes to the map by adding them to an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" object.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Configure the appearance of an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"’s or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shapes collectively using a concrete instance of ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Alternatively, you can add some kinds of shapes directly to a map view as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"annotations or overlays.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can filter the features in a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" or vary their layout or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"paint attributes based on the features’ geographies. Pass an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"te